    // ── Texts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    // Reading one takes a few quiet turns and teaches a rite of its school you
    // don't know yet (or Insight, if you know them all). The page is used up.
    (
        id: "hymnal_page",
        name: "hymnal page",
        plural: "hymnal pages",
        glyph: '?',
        color: (226, 214, 170),
        description: "A page torn from a choir book. Between the verses, in a smaller hand: how to make ground holy.",
